          "content": "<p><em>其他</em>*</p>\n<p>（1）一个国外程序员在<a href=\"https://www.ohrg.org/cycling-typing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">自行车训练机</a>的把手上，装了两个分离式键盘，可以一边骑车，一边打字。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202411/bg2024111404.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>（2）CSS 有了一个新的<a href=\"https://michaelcharl.es/aubrey/en/code/new-rebeccapurple-css-logo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">徽标</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202411/bg2024111703.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>（3）<a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2024/11/15/24297261/casio-smart-ring-digital-watch-crw-001-1jr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">卡西欧</a>推出一款形似手表的戒指。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202411/bg2024111908.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202411/bg2024111909.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
