        {
          "title": "排版引擎纵谈：程序员的视角",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202411/bg2024112002.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>本文介绍并对比了几种排版引擎，重点是 CJK 文字处理： HTML + CSS、LaTeX、LaTeX.js、Typst 和 react-pdf。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/5562\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@xiaohanyu</a> 投稿）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "排版引擎纵谈：程序员的视角",
              "url": "https://blog.ppresume.com/posts/zh-cn/on-typesetting-engines"
            },
            {
              "text": "@xiaohanyu",
              "url": "https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/5562"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202411/bg2024112002.webp"
          ]
        },
